Package: dnaEPICO
Title: dnaEPICO: Analysis Pipeline for Illumina DNA Methylation Array Data
Version: 0.99.7
Date: 2026-01-18
Authors@R: c(person("Paul", "Ruiz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
            email = "ruizpint@qut.edu.au", comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-6714-3566")),
            person("Divya", "Mehta", role = "aut",
            comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7971-7255")))
Description:
    This package provides a modular and reproducible framework for the
    preprocessing and analysis of Illumina DNA methylation array 
    data (EPICv2, EPIC and 450K). It supports quality control, probe 
    filtering, cell-type deconvolution, phenotype integration, and 
    downstream statistical modelling using generalised linear and 
    linear mixed-effects models. The package builds on established 
    Bioconductor infrastructure and wraps widely used tools such as 
    'minfi', 'ENmix', and 'wateRmelon', with support for execution 
    on local workstations and high-performance computing environments.
